{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1235171-can-someone-explain-how-connections-work-feeling-lost","id":1235171,"title":"Can someone explain how Connections work? Feeling lost.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-07-14T21:05:57-07:00","id":1235171,"title":"Can someone explain how Connections work? Feeling lost.","content":"As the title reads, I'm a bit lost when it comes to how Connections work in Scion 2e. Could someone clarify the rules for me, please. Not understanding them as written. Might be missing something. Might also just be dumb. <br /> <br /> I get that you can call on your connections based on your Paths, and that companions are built when they are called on, but do you then save those and improve on them when next you call on those same ones? Do you remake them every time? Help please.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24013-amaranth01","name":"Amaranth01","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-14T22:51:42-07:00","id":1235187,"title":"","content":"Ah, that was something that someone asked Neall on the Discord. IIRC, the thing is that you assign a couple dots on your Connection, and those dots last until the end of the session.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/a