2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T06:49:39-07:00","id":1235256,"title":"","content":"You can potentially use it LOTS of times, actually.<br /> <br /> Once for free.<br /> Once again, also basically for free, but giving you the Suspended condition.<br /> You can then use it again, at a small penalty, providing the Revocation Condition.<br /> <br /> BUT, that said, there are rules in the Suspended Condition to resolve that condition via actions during the session. Not, like, HEAVY rules but it implies you can do it. So you can potentially use your contacts more than three times.<br /> <br /> That said, 6 dice of contacts is nothing to laugh at.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/728-crownedsun","name":"CrownedSun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar728_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"217"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T07:05:51-07:00","id":1247005,"title":"","content":"I\u2019ve got a question - I understand stacking up uses through the Conditions, but I\u2019m not clear whether you get 1 use of Connections safely per session or 1 use of each Path\u2019s Connections per session. Do the Paths work independently - Ie., a Player can pull Connections three times in a session by spreading them around? That seems like a lot.<br /> <br /> Also, does calling on Assets count as using the Connection for that Path? The rules are unclear/contradictory on that point.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3874-darchon45","name":"darchon45","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-18T01:12:31-07:00","id":1247306,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>darchon45</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1235171-can-someone-explain-how-connections-work-feeling-lost?p=1247005#post1247005\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I\u2019ve got a question - I understand stacking up uses through the Conditions, but I\u2019m not clear whether you get 1 use of Connections safely per session or 1 use of each Path\u2019s Connections per session. Do the Paths work independently - Ie., a Player can pull Connections three times in a session by spreading them around? That seems like a lot.<br /> <br /> Also, does calling on Assets count as using the Connection for that Path? The rules are unclear/contradictory on that point.</div> </div> </div> </div>I personally would rule each path counts separately before starting to stack up with Conditions, given that sometimes you need to establish other contacts or different things depending on the Path.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}